// Every composite-form mistake the lint is meant to catch, in one file. An
// annotation is a single line in Malloy, so the tag cannot be wrapped.
//
//   - `orders -> missing_view` names a view the source does not have.
//   - `ghost -> x` names a source this file does not import.
//   - `orders -> by_region` filters by REGION, which this file never imports,
//     so the dashboard can show no control for it and it stays at its default.
//   - `dashboard_columns=…` is not a property of this grammar at all.
//   - `# dashboard { columns="wide" }` is not a positive integer.
//
// `orders -> by_brand + { limit: 2 }` is a refinement: legal, not statically
// resolvable, and deliberately not warned about.
## artifact { title="Broken" tiles=["orders -> by_brand + { limit: 2 }", "orders -> missing_view", "ghost -> x", "orders -> by_region"] dashboard_columns=4 } dashboard { columns="wide" }
import { orders } from '../orders.malloy'
